flowchart TD
  A[Select cell] --> B{Board and coordinate valid?}
  B -- No --> X[Reject and preserve board]
  B -- Yes --> C{Empty or owned by active player?}
  C -- No --> X
  C -- Yes --> D[Clone board and add one orb]
  D --> E{Critical mass reached?}
  E -- No --> F[Return settled board]
  E -- Yes --> G[Queue unstable coordinate]
  G --> H[Dequeue and read latest cell state]
  H --> I[Burst and distribute orthogonally]
  I --> J[Transfer neighbor ownership]
  J --> K{More unstable cells?}
  K -- Yes --> G
  K -- No --> L{Burst safety limit reached?}
  L -- Yes --> X
  L -- No --> F
  F --> M[Record player participation]
  M --> N{All players entered and one owner remains?}
  N -- Yes --> W[Declare winner]
  N -- No --> P[Select next unplayed or surviving player]
